This file records the licenses of third-party source that has been adapted
into the Empyralis codebase. Each entry lists what was adapted, where it now
lives, and the upstream license text in full.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
hermes-agent — Nous Research
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream:   https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
License:     MIT
Version referenced: 0.15.2

Adapted into Empyralis:
  - server_modules/docker_execution_sandbox.py
      Hardened-container security posture (cap-drop ALL + minimal selective
      re-adds, --security-opt no-new-privileges, --pids-limit, nosuid/noexec
      size-capped tmpfs mounts, non-root --user, --init) derived from
      hermes-agent tools/environments/docker.py `_BASE_SECURITY_ARGS` /
      `_PRIVDROP_CAP_ARGS`.
  - server_modules/gateway_credential_lock.py
      Machine-local scoped credential lock (atomic O_CREAT|O_EXCL lock file
      keyed by scope + hash(identity); PID + process-start-time staleness to
      survive PID reuse) derived from hermes-agent gateway/status.py
      `acquire_scoped_lock` / `release_scoped_lock`.

